===Etymology 2===
{{etymon|en|id=river edge}}
[[File:Perfume River Bank, as seen from Trường Tiền Bridge, 2019.jpg|thumb|A river '''bank''' ({{senseno|en|edge}})]]

From {{inh|en|enm|bank}}, from {{der|en|ang|hobanca|hōbanca|couch}} and {{der|en|ang|banc||bank, hillock, embankment}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*bankô}}. Akin to {{cog|non|bakki||elevation, hill}}, {{cog|no|bakke||slope, hill}}.

